# Linear

Call Linear as the connected user through the Linear MCP server connected to
this session. The session's MCP relay attaches the user's credential on every
call; never ask for or handle credentials yourself.

{{ACTION_AVAILABILITY_SECTION}}

## Usage

Read tools (the connected user, teams, issues, search, projects) run freely;
creating an issue and commenting are the writes. Read tools that paginate
should be capped with a result limit to keep your context small.

