### Projects

Projects list each project's linked teams.

### Create an issue (write)

A new issue needs a team id (from the teams tool), a title, and optionally a
description, assignee user id, project id, workflow state, priority, labels,
estimate, and a parent issue.

The workflow state is accepted as a name (resolved case-insensitively against
the team's states) or a state id. Priority is an int 0-4 (0 none, 1 urgent,
2 high, 3 normal, 4 low).

