## Output

Tool results are JSON. List tools return the items and whether more existed
past the limit; failures return GraphQL-style `errors` — surface the error
rather than retrying blindly.

## Notes

- Creating an issue needs a team id (from the teams tool); the assignee takes
  a user id, the project a project id (from the projects tool), and
  labels/parent take label/issue ids.
- If the server exposes a generic GraphQL tool, pass user input as variables,
  not by string-formatting into the query.
